---
description: A grid feature was used without its module being registered first.
---

## Module Not Registered

The grid was asked for a feature that the missing module provides, but that module was never registered, so the feature is unavailable. Register {% errorParam name="moduleName" fallback="RowGrouping" suffix="Module" /%} to enable it.

